<p>Two local passenger trains collided head-on early Thursday near Hillerød, north of Copenhagen, injuring 18 people. Five were reported in critical condition, according to emergency services and multiple news outlets. Responders described heavy front-end damage and shattered glass inside the carriages. Authorities said the cause was still unclear. Emergency crews launched a large response, including helicopters to transport some of the injured, and police said all passengers were evacuated from the trains.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/UmSlp_Qyo_y4ZL8tY07yOIWatSdTwj4qXJNc2uJGfUeiMoAtl_4JxB7hTEsIRy_qMSGOoK6RuMPOUMxWh3bWbTrU9q7E6i0bjXrQHAoyUbhS' alt='A damaged train is pictured after two trains collided between the towns of Hillerod and Kagerup, north of Copenhagen, leaving many injured, on April 23, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Emergency response: The alert went out at about 6:30 a.m., and authorities sent large numbers of police, fire crews, and medical teams to the crash scene.</li><li>Inside carriages: Rescue leaders described the train interiors as &quot;chaotic,&quot; saying the head-on impact caused extensive damage and sent broken glass through the passenger areas.</li><li>Community use: Gribskov mayor Trine Egetved said local residents, workers, and students rely heavily on the line, underscoring the disruption to daily travel in the area.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Police: Police called the collision a serious accident, sealed off the area, and said emergency services had deployed in large numbers as crews secured the scene. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/denmark-train-collision-copenhagen-injured-updates/article70896159.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Emergency services: Fire and rescue officials described severe damage to both trains and chaotic conditions inside the carriages after the head-on impact. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3351119/trains-collide-head-denmark-causing-multiple-injuries'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>Gribskov municipality: Mayor Trine Egetved said local authorities were working to piece together what happened while making sure injured passengers got help. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1994336/many-injured-in-head-on-train-crash-in-denmark'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3351119/trains-collide-head-denmark-causing-multiple-injuries'>Trains collide head-on in Denmark, injuring 18</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/23/world/europe/denmark-trains-collision-copenhagen.html'>Trains Collide in Denmark, Leaving 5 Critically Injured</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/denmark-two-trains-collide-injuring-several/a-76904246'>Denmark: Two trains collide injuring several</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/denmark-train-collision-copenhagen-injured-updates/article70896159.ece'>Two trains collide in Denmark, leaving several critically injured</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/video/2026/04/23/two-trains-collide-head-on-in-denmark-leaving-multiple-injured'>Two trains collide head-on in Denmark, leaving multiple injured</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1994336/many-injured-in-head-on-train-crash-in-denmark'>Many injured in head-on train crash in Denmark</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cgqkw3qk0dlo'>Two trains collide head-on in Denmark, leaving five critically hurt</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/2-trains-collide-denmark-prompting-massive-emergency-response-132301261'>2 trains collide in Denmark, leaving 5 people critically injured</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/4/23/two-trains-crash-head-on-in-denmark'>Two trains crash head-on in Denmark</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://